# Kilo agent scaffolding. It creates git worktrees under .kilo/worktrees/,
# which git hides from status only while they are registered — once one is
# removed or left behind it shows up as untracked clutter, and ESLint scans
# it as a second copy of the whole repo (525 warnings instead of 264).
.kilo/

